--- make
description: A KScript script in scripts/, run with kscript <file>
category: Scripts and data
usage: <name> [--syntax kscript|xml]
--syntax: kscript or xml (default the project's make.syntax)
example: kscript make script tidy-downloads
example: kscript make script tools/backup --syntax xml
to: {{ paths.scripts }}/{{ dir }}{{ kebab }}{{ ext }}
hint: Run it: kscript {{ paths.scripts }}/{{ dir }}{{ kebab }}{{ ext }}
---
// TODO: Write what the script does.
echo "Hello from {{ title }}!"
